# Verification and safety

- Verify before claiming completion; save evidence.
- Ask before: `terraform apply/destroy`, production load tests, DB deletion, IAM policy expansion, public endpoint exposure.
- Set billing alarms before billable resources. Working budget: target ~$25–40 / soft max $75 / hard check $100 against ~$170 credits; 3–4 day cloud window.
- Never commit `.env`, keys, tfstate secrets, real PII.
- Git root is this repo only. No nested repos. No force-push. Commit/push only when user asks.
- Statuses TESTED/CLOUD_VERIFIED require actual evidence paths in the requirements matrix.
